// lexdb_exec: MATCH_RECOGNIZE (design/lexdb-match-recognize.md) through the PostgreSQL door's executor.
// The fixtures are the design's section 10 (Oracle Database Free 23ai's answers, CLASSIFIER in lower case);
// the rest are hand-checked.
