// expect: star of output: a|5 b|3
// expect: column list: a|5 b|3
// expect: binds: 3 1
// expect: explain: scan m: rows of subquery 1 subquery 1 (from): run once   match_recognize: partition by g; order by id nulls last; measures c; pattern (a+ b); one row per match; skip past last row; define a; memo   scan t: full scan
// expect: e partition unknown: 42703
// expect: e column unknown: 42703
// expect: e lateral unknown outer column: 42703
// expect: e qualifier unknown: 42P01
// expect: e input alias: 42P01
// expect: e two variables: 42601
